PokemonMansion_1F_Text_SimonIntro::
    .string "This place is, like, huge!$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_SimonDefeat::
    .string "Ayah!$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_SimonPostBattle::
    .string "I wonder where my partner went.$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_BraydonIntro::
    .string "My mentor once lived here.$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_BraydonDefeat::
    .string "Whew!\n"
    .string "Overwhelming!$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_BraydonPostBattle::
    .string "So, you're stuck?\n"
    .string "Try jumping off over there!$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_MewGaveBirthToMewtwo::
    .string "Diary: Feb. 6\n"
    .string "MEW gave birth.\p"
    .string "We named the newborn MEWTWO.$"

PokemonMansion_3F_Text_RivalReady::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Still poking around?\p"
    .string "Good. Maybe you're not completely\n"
    .string "useless after all.\p"
    .string "I don't know what's waiting below,\n"
    .string "but it isn't nothing.\p"
    .string "So? Are you ready, or are you\n"
    .string "going to turn back?$"

PokemonMansion_3F_Text_RivalNotReady::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Hah!\n"
    .string "Thought so.\p"
    .string "Come back when you stop looking\n"
    .string "like you need a permission slip.$"

PokemonMansion_3F_Text_RivalBattleIntro::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Then prove it.\n"
    .string "Try keeping up!$"

PokemonMansion_3F_Text_RivalDefeat::
    .string "Tch.\n"
    .string "Fine, you're ready enough.$"

PokemonMansion_3F_Text_RivalPostBattle::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Whatever's below,\n"
    .string "don't slow me down.\p"
    .string "I'm checking the rest of this\n"
    .string "place.\p"
    .string "Try not to fall apart.$"
